  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.03",
    "summary": "Units leave a **TRANSPORT** model in two ways:\n\n- During their own Movement phase, each one of the active player's embarked units may make a **[Disembark Move](vsdata:core-rule/disembark-move)** (rule 18.04).\n- If the **TRANSPORT** model is **destroyed**, each unit inside it is required to make an [Emergency Disembark Move](vsdata:core-rule/emergency-disembark-move) (rule 18.05), resolved by the active player before the model is removed.",
